# SVE License v6.0
### Universal Human Heritage & Reciprocity License — Consolidated Anti-Enclosure & Constitutional Equality Edition
*(This is the short-form, operative **License**, referenced by its filename throughout the Registry and hash chain. It is a separate instrument from, and should not be confused with, the longer, separately-hashed **SVE Meta-License** document, which restates and extends the original v4.0 Core Principles and Appendices A–G framework this License continues to cite and depend on.)*

> **Maxim I.** The fruits, for all Humanity, must be good — measured continually, on different cycles; some ripen slower.
>
> **Maxim II.** Live by your skills and talents — not by your secrets.
>
> **Maxim III.** *"Do not give dogs what is holy, and do not throw your pearls before pigs, lest they trample them underfoot and turn to attack you."* — Matthew 7:6.

*v6.0 **extends and envelops** v5.5 (which extends v5.0, which extends v4.0, which extends v1.3 = CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 + SVE Addendum). v5.5 repaired the §3→§4 dead-branch cascade of v5.0, narrowed §1's overreach to what copyright can actually hold, and added fifteen protections: interim-amendment legitimacy, standalone validity independent of any prior version's fate, a no-veto Contribution Rule, Tool & Synthesizer Independence (an AI provider's own logs cannot substitute for the Registry as a defense), explicit Latent Activation with channel-independence (piracy does not exempt), an AI-training/TDM closure with a discovery duty and an explicit closed-system clarification (reading is free; incorporation while closed is a full breach, with no new status-based exception to Universal Access), the Natural-Person Licensee Rule, the Wholeness Clause, the Ethical-Use Floor, absolute Universal Access with no fallback downgrade ever available for it, an End-User Fruits Duty, a Research Integrity & Truth-Bearer track, Reciprocal-Audit-Priority, an explicit Asymmetric Rigor principle (easy for the compliant, uncompromising for the rest), and a No Secondary Secrecy rule closing confidentiality/NDA workarounds. **v6.0 adds six further protections.** First, closing the one gap v5.5 itself flagged in its own text (§14): **the Natural-Person Rule (§2) is elevated to the same non-severable, no-fallback footing as Universal Access (§6.2–§6.5)** — a legal entity can never become a direct, unmediated holder of this License in any jurisdiction on Earth; where that cannot be honored, the License is void there rather than read down to permit it. Second, **§6.2's Universal Access guarantee gains a single, mechanical, jurisdiction-blind operative standard (§6.9)**: a jurisdiction is **TRUE** only where a single, express equality-by-birth clause — even just one article, no full codified constitution required — cannot be touched by any domestic mechanism whatsoever, not ordinary legislation, not constitutional amendment, not referendum; every other jurisdiction is **UNKNOWN**. Persons are never the ones who pay for that: nobody may ever be denied the product or service because their jurisdiction is UNKNOWN — that would be an ordinary §6.2 breach. What changes for an UNKNOWN jurisdiction is where the product or service may be hosted and where its money may go: **no infrastructure based there, and zero revenue remitted there**, until it becomes TRUE — the identical test, the identical consequence, applied identically, to every one of the roughly 190 sovereign states on Earth, none named, none exempted. Third, **within an UNKNOWN jurisdiction, a natural person's access defaults to personal, free, non-commercial use (§6.9.14)**: commercial terms remain available there only for a transaction that generates zero tax or fiscal payment to that jurisdiction's own government — the moment a taxable local nexus would otherwise arise, no price is charged, so nothing is sold and nothing is there to tax; nobody is served worse than §6.9.1 already guarantees, but no UNKNOWN jurisdiction's treasury draws revenue from a population whose equal standing by birth it cannot itself guarantee. **Fourth, §6.9 now tests two further, wholly independent indicators alongside that equality-by-birth test (Indicator I): whether a jurisdiction's own institutions may be paying customers at all (Indicator II, §6.9.16), unlocked only by that jurisdiction's own binding commitment to direct 10% of the revenue its institutions generate under this License, and the bulk of its own relevant know-how, to a randomly and consensually paired "Child" jurisdiction for a six-plus-one-year Parent–Child Reciprocity Program.** The default here runs opposite to a natural person's: absent that jurisdiction-level commitment, and absent the specific institution's own named, personally accountable representative, no grant of any kind subsists for that institution at all — nothing free, nothing paid; only a natural person is served by default, and only a natural person's access can be taken away by anything less than an audit-proven bad-fruits finding (§6.9.19, the Asymmetric Default). **Fifth, a substantive floor beneath both — Indicator III, §6.9.17, "the Gate" — holds that a documented, sustained pattern of ethnic, national, religious, ancestral, or linguistic suppression in a jurisdiction's ordinary civic life, proven (not merely alleged) by the same independent, non-partisan evidentiary standard §6.9.8 already applies, zeroes that jurisdiction's Indicator I and Indicator II status alike, regardless of what either would otherwise show; a jurisdiction not shown to fail it is entirely unaffected by it, exactly as an unassessed jurisdiction is unaffected by Indicator I.** **Sixth, §4.9 extends §11 SVE-Unicorns Founder Mode's own freeze principle from a size-thresholded venture to any natural person: a (God) Father facing genuine danger — commercial, personal, or political — may freeze disclosure of a Corpus-based Artifact for as long as they live, registered from day one and fully auditable throughout, on the one absolute condition (Maxim III, Matthew 7:6) that everything becomes disclosed and freely available the moment they die.** It **cannot weaken** §0 (Fruits Test) or the Core Principles of Meta-License v4.0 — it only strengthens and repairs. **Authoritative language: English.***

